{"id":"en_un-estate-con-una-superstar","title":"Un'estate con una superstar","titleEn":"Un'estate con una superstar","description":"Model student Georgia Pruitt accidentally shoves rockstar Riot Cross off a stage, prompting her strict father to send her to Silver Pines, a rehabilitation camp. Riot's label dispatches him to the same place. Paired as support partners, the two adversaries gradually fall for each other amid bullying, lakeside rescues, a stolen kiss, and a rewritten love song. Leaked photos force them apart, but Riot jumps from a departing car to sing with her on stage. Together they pick love and music school, giving up Harvard and the tour.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/unestate-con-una-superstar/it_IT/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/unestate-con-una-superstar/it_IT/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fare il finto tonto","Giovane adulto","Identità segreta","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d734k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_un-estate-con-una-superstar_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d734k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_un-estate-con-una-superstar_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d734k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_un-estate-con-una-superstar_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d734k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_un-estate-con-una-superstar_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","ur